# Phase discipline

Current phase is `AGENTS.md` + `docs/scope.md`. Do not install or wire the next phase’s stack.

## Now (Phase 1 — UI mock)

Mock data only in `lib/mock-data.ts`. `DEV_ROLE` is the session role. Current user = the `Person` whose `role === DEV_ROLE` (`getDevUser()` / `DEV_USER_ID` once added). Sign-in does not authenticate.

Optimistic send / react / reply = local component state (including swipe-to-reply). No Zustand/Redux/global message store. No `fetch` to a missing API. No fake JWT. No SecureStore.

Dead controls stay dead: inbox compose, thread attach. No `Alert('coming soon')` fake flows.

RBAC capability ≠ UI this phase. Do not render internal notes. Do not build accept-from-pool, assign/transfer, delete, or broadcast screens.

Do not install: TanStack Query, socket.io-client, expo-sqlite, Drizzle, better-auth, expo-secure-store, expo-image, react-native-keyboard-controller, i18next, FlashList, LegendList.

Never edit `.env`. Never commit secrets. Do not log message bodies or PII.

## Phase bump

Same change must update: `AGENTS.md` (Now + spec link), `docs/scope.md` (phase list), this file, `.cursor/rules/expo-router.mdc`, and `project-scope.mdc` if the product surface changed.
